          "status": "ANTIUNITARY Z2 OF THE SPECTRUM, QUADRATIC",
          "mechanism": "H(-phi, p) = conj(H(phi, p)) for ARBITRARY p; H Hermitian so conj(H) = H^T is isospectral",
